## Motion rules

- **One load sequence**, on first paint only: {{what animates, in order}}
- Purposeful transitions elsewhere: {{hover/press/expand — what changes and why}}
- Durations: `--duration-fast` {{120ms}}, `--duration-base` {{200ms}},
  `--duration-slow` {{320ms}}. Easings: `--easing-standard`,
  `--easing-entrance`, `--easing-exit`.
- Animated properties are `transform` and `opacity` only — never `width`,
  `height`, `top` or `left`.
- `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` disables the load sequence and every
  non-essential transition. State which transitions survive and why.

