## Accessibility

Target: **WCAG 2.2 AA**. AA conformance is a gate, not a score.

- Body text contrast ≥ 4.5:1; large text (≥24px, or ≥18.66px bold) ≥ 3:1;
  UI component boundaries and focus indicators ≥ 3:1.
- Every interactive element is reachable and operable by keyboard, with a
  visible `:focus-visible` state that is not obscured by other content.
- Target size ≥ 24×24 CSS px.
- `prefers-reduced-motion` honoured.
- Accessible name for every icon-only control.

## Performance budget

| Metric | Budget |
|---|---|
| CLS | ≤ 0.1 |
| LCP | ≤ 2.5 s |
| Images | sized (`width`/`height` attributes or `aspect-ratio`) and lazy below the fold |
| Animation | `transform` / `opacity` only; no layout thrash |
| Fonts | ≤ 2 families, `font-display: swap`, preloaded |

